From 3d6176c375b1acca970724ca543246be17746017 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lzc256 <i@lzc256.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 10:02:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(new-api): add state persistence + RestrictedPython +
 seccomp for balance script

- Add BalanceScriptState column for persisting script state (max 64KB)
- Input via env vars (CHANNEL_BASE_URL/KEY/STATE, etc.), no os.Environ() inheritance
- Output: JSON {balance, state} or plain number (backward compatible)
- RestrictedPython: compile_restricted + safe_builtins + safer_getattr + import whitelist
- seccomp: allow read-only open + network, deny write/execve/fork
- Atomic state update with GetChannelPollingLock serialization
- Update frontend template with state example
- Install RestrictedPython + seccomp in Dockerfile
- Remove stale balance-script.patch
